    "body": "Using the micro:bit this means creating a file `/etc/udev/rules.d/80-microbit.rules` with the content:\r\n\r\n> SUBSYSTEM==\"usb\", ATTR{idVendor}==\"0d28\", ATTR{idProduct}==\"0204\", MODE=\"0660\", GROUP=\"plugdev\"\r\n\r\nNo reboot was necessary.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
